@startuml
title 시퀀스: 몬스터 패턴 준비/발동 흐름

participant MonsterUnit as "MonsterUnit"
participant MonsterAI as "MonsterAI/Pattern"
participant BattleStage as "BattleStage"
participant ResultQueue as "ResultQueue"

MonsterUnit -> MonsterAI: SelectPattern()
activate MonsterAI
MonsterAI --> MonsterUnit: pattern selected (skillIdx, timing)
deactivate MonsterAI

note right: 패턴 타이밍까지 대기(유예)
MonsterUnit -> BattleStage: NotifyPatternReady(patternSkillIdx)
activate BattleStage
BattleStage -> ResultQueue: Enqueue(patternResult)
deactivate BattleStage

note over ResultQueue: 패턴에 따른 스킬/공격은 result 처리 파이프라인으로 이동

@enduml
